Description: Research compendium with the SHILD and PISA analyses, public
    aggregate results, figure sources, and the computational supplement of the
    article. It is not an R package; the file marks the repository root for the
    analysis scripts and records their dependencies. The code is licensed under
    the LGPL-3 (file LICENSE); the aggregate result tables and figures are
    released under CC BY 4.0 (file LICENSE-CC-BY-4.0.txt).
